ECHO ============================================================
ECHO CALC NUMERIC LITERAL 1000 PROBE
ECHO ============================================================

ECHO --- BASIC LITERALS ---
CALC 10
CALC 100
CALC 1000
CALC 10000

ECHO --- SIMPLE ARITHMETIC ---
CALC 1000 + 1
CALC 1000 - 1
CALC 1000 / 10
CALC 1000 * 2

ECHO --- OTHER FUNCTIONS WITH 1000 ---
CALC ABS(1000)
CALC INT(1000)
CALC ROUND(1000,0)
CALC SQRT(1000)
CALC MAX(1000,1)
CALC MIN(1000,1)
CALC BETWEEN(1000,1,2000)

ECHO --- LOG FAMILY ---
CALC LOG(999)
CALC LOG(1000)
CALC LOG(1001)
CALC LOG10(999)
CALC LOG10(1000)
CALC LOG10(1001)

ECHO ============================================================
ECHO CALC NUMERIC LITERAL 1000 PROBE DONE
ECHO ============================================================